{title: Swing Low, Sweet Chariot}
{artist: Spirituál}
{key: D}
{meta: notation en}

{start_of_chorus}
Swing [D]low, sweet [G]chari[D]ot,
coming for to carry me [A7]home,
swing [D7]low, sweet [G]chari[D]ot,
coming for to [A7]carry me [D]home.
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: label="1."}
[D]I looked over Jordan and [G]what did I [D]see,
coming for to carry me [A7]home?
A [D7]band of angels [G]coming after [D]me,
coming for to [A7]carry me [D]home.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

{start_of_verse: label="2."}
[D]If you get there be[G]fore I [D]do,
coming for to carry me [A7]home,
just [D7]tell all my friends I'm [G]coming [D]too,
coming for to [A7]carry me [D]home.
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
